What of LocalSend is actually in LinkX (as of 2026-09-30):
  only the receive-side filename rules, ported into
  `Crates/transfer/src/filename.rs` — the single source of truth for turning a
  peer-supplied file name into a safe on-disk name.
  The vendored upstream tree (`Crates/vendor/localsend/`, 60 files) and the
  never-wired interop layer (`Crates/transfer/src/ls_interop.rs`) have been
  removed from this repository: real development never used them. `Cargo.lock`
  dropped from 287 to 160 crates and no longer contains tokio / hyper /
  reqwest / rustls.

